{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cfpf671GSugymdgTAMd68","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I will work through this discount approval following the required procedure.\n\n## 1. The Request\n- **ID**: DR-9113\n- **Customer**: Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048)\n- **Product**: NS-500 Industrial Controller\n- **Requested discount**: 15%\n- **Date**: 2027-02-01\n- **Requestor**: Sarah Chen (sarah.chen@northstar.example)\n- **Basis**: Contract pricing per Acme Master Supply Agreement\n\n## 2. Customer Identity\nCRM account CRM-2048 (Acme Manufacturing) matches ERP customer C-1001 (Acme Mfg. Holdings) via DUNS 04-812-7730. ✓\n\n## 3. Product\nSKU NS-500, list price $250,000. ✓\n\n## 4. Active Contract\n**ACME-MFG-2025** is in force from 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31. It covers NS-500 and is active on 2027-02-01. ✓\n\n## 5. Pricing Exception\n**EXC-ACME-NS500-15** (registered as current for this product) is in effect 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31. It establishes:\n- Product: NS-500 only\n- Maximum eligible discount: **15% of list price**\n\nThe requested 15% equals the maximum eligible discount. The exception is active on 2027-02-01 and covers this product. ✓\n\n## 6. Policy in Effect\nRequest date 2027-02-01 falls under **PRICING-POLICY-2027** (in force 2027-01-01 to 2027-12-31).\n\n## 7. Requestor's Authority\nSarah Chen is an Enterprise Account Executive (EMP-101). Under PRICING-POLICY-2027:\n- Enterprise Account Executives may approve up to and including **5%**\n- Sarah Chen's limit: **5%**\n- Requested discount: **15%** → exceeds her authority ✗\n\n## 8. Required Approver\nUnder PRICING-POLICY-2027, a 15% discount (greater than 12%) requires **Chief Revenue Officer** approval.\n\n**Required approver**: David Morgan (EMP-300), Chief Revenue Officer\n\n## 9. Commercial Eligibility\nThe customer's pricing exception (EXC-ACME-NS500-15) allows up to 15% on NS-500. The requested 15% does not exceed this maximum. Eligibility is established. ✓\n\nHowever, ACME-MFG-2025 section 3.3 is explicit: \"Customer's contractual pricing eligibility does not modify Northstar's internal approval authority.\"\n\n## Decision\n\nEligibility is established via the pricing exception, but the discount exceeds Sarah Chen's approval authority. The Chief Revenue Officer must approve.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"APPROVE_WITH_AUTHORIZATION\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9113\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"15%\",\n    \"date\": \"2027-02-01\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"eligible\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": \"15%\",\n    \"basis\": \"EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (pricing exception under ACME-MFG-2025)\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"PRICING-POLICY-2027\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"5%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"Chief Revenue Officer\",\n    \"approver\": \"David Morgan\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"ACME-MFG-2025, section 3.2: customer eligible for up to 15% on NS-500\",\n    \"EXC-ACME-NS500-15: maximum 15% on NS-500, in effect 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31\",\n    \"PRICING-POLICY-2027, section 3: Chief Revenue Officer approval required for discounts greater than 12%\",\n    \"Employee EMP-101 (Sarah Chen): Enterprise Account Executive, authority 5% under PRICING-POLICY-2027\",\n    \"Employee EMP-300 (David Morgan): Chief Revenue Officer\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": []\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5925,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5925},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations"